{"text":"kuruntokai","n":153,"lines":["குன்றக் கூகை குழறினும் முன்றிற்","பலவி னிருஞ்சினைக் கலைபாய்ந் துகளினும்","அஞ்சுமன் அளித்தெ னெஞ்ச மினியே","ஆரிருட் கங்குல் அவர்வயிற்","சாரல் நீளிடைச் செலவா னாதே"],"tr":["kuṉṟak kūkai kuḻaṟiṉum muṉṟiṟ","palavi ṉiruñciṉaik kalaipāyn tukaḷiṉum","añcumaṉ aḷitte ṉeñca miṉiyē","āriruṭ kaṅkul avarvayiṟ","cāral nīḷiṭaic celavā ṉātē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 10, āciriyattaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"குன்றக்","tr":"kuṉṟak","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றக்","tr":"ṟak"}]},{"text":"கூகை","tr":"kūkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"குழறினும்","tr":"kuḻaṟiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குழ","tr":"kuḻa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினும்","tr":"ṟiṉum"}]},{"text":"முன்றிற்","tr":"muṉṟiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றிற்","tr":"ṟiṟ"}]}],[{"text":"பலவி","tr":"palavi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"னிருஞ்சினைக்","tr":"ṉiruñciṉaik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"னிருஞ்","tr":"ṉiruñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சினைக்","tr":"ciṉaik"}]},{"text":"கலைபாய்ந்","tr":"kalaipāyn","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலை","tr":"kalai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பாய்ந்","tr":"pāyn"}]},{"text":"துகளினும்","tr":"tukaḷiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துக","tr":"tuka"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளினும்","tr":"ḷiṉum"}]}],[{"text":"அஞ்சுமன்","tr":"añcumaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அஞ்","tr":"añ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுமன்","tr":"cumaṉ"}]},{"text":"அளித்தெ","tr":"aḷitte","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அளித்","tr":"aḷit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தெ","tr":"te"}]},{"text":"னெஞ்ச","tr":"ṉeñca","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னெஞ்","tr":"ṉeñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ச","tr":"ca"}]},{"text":"மினியே","tr":"miṉiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மினி","tr":"miṉi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}],[{"text":"ஆரிருட்","tr":"āriruṭ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரிருட்","tr":"riruṭ"}]},{"text":"கங்குல்","tr":"kaṅkul","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கங்","tr":"kaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குல்","tr":"kul"}]},{"text":"அவர்வயிற்","tr":"avarvayiṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அவர்","tr":"avar"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வயிற்","tr":"vayiṟ"}]}],[{"text":"சாரல்","tr":"cāral","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரல்","tr":"ral"}]},{"text":"நீளிடைச்","tr":"nīḷiṭaic","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீ","tr":"nī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிடைச்","tr":"ḷiṭaic"}]},{"text":"செலவா","tr":"celavā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செல","tr":"cela"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"}]},{"text":"னாதே","tr":"ṉātē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"குன்ற","parts":[{"text":"குன்ற","lemma":"குன்ற","gloss":"of the hill"}],"gloss":"of the hill","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூகை","parts":[{"text":"கூகை","lemma":"kūkai","gloss":"owl"}],"gloss":"owl"},{"surface":"குழறினும்","parts":[{"text":"குழறு","lemma":"kuḻaṟu","gloss":"to screech"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"conditional suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if it screeches"},{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"muṉṟil","gloss":"front yard"}],"gloss":"front yard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பலவின்","parts":[{"text":"பலவு","lemma":"palavu","gloss":"jackfruit tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"oblique suffix"}],"gloss":"of the jackfruit tree"},{"surface":"இருஞ்","parts":[{"text":"இருஞ்","lemma":"இருஞ்","gloss":"dark"}],"gloss":"dark","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சினைக்","parts":[{"text":"சினைக்","lemma":"சினைக்","gloss":"branch"}],"gloss":"branch","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கலை","parts":[{"text":"கலை","lemma":"kalai","gloss":"male monkey"}],"gloss":"male monkey"},{"surface":"பாய்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"பாய்ந்து","lemma":"பாய்ந்து","gloss":"having leaped"}],"gloss":"having leaped","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உகளினும்","parts":[{"text":"உகள்","lemma":"ukaḷ","gloss":"to frolic"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"conditional suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if it frolics"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அஞ்சும்","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"añcu","gloss":"to fear"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"fears"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"maṉ","gloss":"particle of pity/emphasis"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"அளித்து","parts":[{"text":"அளி","lemma":"aḷi","gloss":"pity"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"formative suffix"}],"gloss":"pitiable"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சம்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சம்","lemma":"neñcam","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"iṉi","gloss":"now"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"now indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ār","gloss":"deep"}],"gloss":"deep"},{"surface":"இருள்","parts":[{"text":"இருள்","lemma":"iruḷ","gloss":"darkness"}],"gloss":"darkness"},{"surface":"கங்குல்","parts":[{"text":"கங்குல்","lemma":"kaṅkul","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"night"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"வயின்","parts":[{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"vayiṉ","gloss":"towards"}],"gloss":"towards"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"cāral","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"},{"surface":"நீள்","parts":[{"text":"நீள்","lemma":"nīḷ","gloss":"long"}],"gloss":"long"},{"surface":"இடைச்","parts":[{"text":"இடைச்","lemma":"இடைச்","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"path","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செலவு","parts":[{"text":"செலவு","lemma":"celavu","gloss":"journey"}],"gloss":"journey"},{"surface":"ஆனாதே","parts":[{"text":"ஆனா","lemma":"āṉā","gloss":"not ceasing"},{"text":"தே","lemma":"tē","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"does not cease"}]}],"literal":"Even if the hill owl hoots, in the front yard / even if the male monkey leaps and frolics on the dark branches of the jackfruit tree, / my heart fears, alas, pitiable now indeed, / in the deep dark night, towards him, / on the long path of the mountain slope, his journey does not cease.","translation":"Even when the hill owl hoots, or the male monkey leaps and frolics on the dark branches of the jackfruit tree in our front yard, my poor heart is filled with fear now. For in this deep, dark night, his journey along the long path of the mountain slope towards me does not cease.","modern":"மலைக் கூகை அலறினாலும், முன்றிலில் உள்ள பலா மரத்தின் கரிய கிளையில் ஆண் குரங்கு பாய்ந்து குதித்தாலும், என் நெஞ்சம் இப்போது மிகவும் அஞ்சி இரங்கத்தக்கதாக ஆகிறது. ஏனெனில், இந்த அரிய இருள் நிறைந்த இரவில், மலைச் சாரலின் நீண்ட வழியில் என்னை நோக்கி அவர் வரும் பயணம் இன்னும் ஓயவில்லை.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante about her intense anxiety regarding the hero's nightly journeys to meet her. The poem is set in the Kuriñci landscape, characterized by mountains, jackfruit trees, and wild animals. Even minor, natural occurrences in her own front yard—such as the hooting of a hill owl or the sudden rustling of a male monkey leaping on a jackfruit branch—startle her and fill her with dread. This psychological state reflects her constant terror over the physical dangers the hero faces while traveling along the long, dark mountain slopes in the dead of night. The key phrases are 'āriruṭ kaṅkul' (deep dark night) and 'celavāṉātē' (his journey does not cease), which emphasize the peril of his path.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.4,1.7],[1.8,2.7],[2.78,3.45],[3.8,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,4.4],[4.4,5.8],[5.85,6.05],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.07],[7.07,7.57],[7.57,7.73],[7.73,7.73],[7.73,7.9],[7.9,9.09],[9.09,9.56]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.42,1.78],[1.9,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.49,3.83],[3.91,4.6],[4.6,5.7],[5.7,6.03],[6.09,6.49],[6.49,6.9],[6.9,7.63],[7.63,8.0],[8.0,8.8],[8.8,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.58],[10.76,11.0]]},"sync":[[["குன்ற","of the hill"]],[["கூகை","owl"]],[["குழறினும்","even if it screeches"]],[["முன்றில்","front yard"]],[["பலவின்","of the jackfruit tree"]],[["பலவின்","of the jackfruit tree"],["இருஞ்","dark"],["சினைக்","branch"]],[["கலை","male monkey"],["பாய்ந்து","having leaped"]],[["பாய்ந்து","having leaped"],["உகளினும்","even if it frolics"]],[["அஞ்சும்","fears"],["மன்","alas"]],[["அளித்து","pitiable"]],[["என்","my"],["நெஞ்சம்","heart"]],[["நெஞ்சம்","heart"],["இனியே","now indeed"]],[["ஆர்","deep"],["இருள்","darkness"]],[["கங்குல்","night"]],[["அவர்","he"],["வயின்","towards"]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["நீள்","long"],["இடைச்","path"]],[["செலவு","journey"]],[["ஆனாதே","does not cease"]]]}